     "t": "Ayah 9: kya tumhein un logon ki khabar nahi pahunchi jo tum se pehle the: Nuh ki qaum, \u2018Aad aur Thamud aur un ke baad aane walon ki, jinhein Allah ke siwa koi nahi jaanta? Unke Rasool unke paas saaf nishaniyan le kar aaye to unhon ne apne haath apne munh mein daal liye aur kaha \u2018hum us paighaam ka inkaar karte hain jis ke saath tumhein bheja gaya, aur hum us cheez ke baare mein jis ki taraf tum hamein bulate ho bade shak mein hain\u2019. Ibn Kathir (\u2018Earlier Nations disbelieved in Their Prophets\u2019): Allah ne is ummat ko Nuh, \u2018Aad, Thamud aur doosri purani qaumon ke qisse sunaye jinhon ne apne Rasoolon ko jhutlaya; unki ginti sirf Allah jaanta hai. Ibn Ishaq ke mutabiq \u2018Abdullah ne kaha ke \u2018nasab jaanne wale jhoot bolte hain\u2019, isi liye \u2018Urwah bin Az-Zubayr ne kaha ke \u2018hum ne Ma\u2018add bin \u2018Adnan ke baap-dadaon ko jaanne wala koi nahi paaya\u2019. \u2018Haath munh mein daalne\u2019 ke baare mein Ibn Kathir ne kai maane naql kiye: kuch ne kaha ke unhon ne Rasoolon ke munh ki taraf ishara kiya ke Allah ki taraf bulana band karo; doosre ne kaha ke inkaar mein munh par haath rakha; kuch ne kaha ke jawab na diya ya gusse mein haath kaate; Mujahid, Muhammad bin Ka\u2018b aur Qatadah ne kaha ke unhon ne Rasoolon ko jhutlaya."
