     "t": "Ayah 10\u201312: unke Rasoolon ne kaha \u2018kya Allah ke baare mein shak hai jo aasmanon aur zameen ka paida karne wala hai? Woh tumhein bulata hai taake tumhare gunaah bakhshe aur ek muqarrar muddat tak mohlat de\u2019. Unhon ne kaha \u2018tum to hum jaise insaan ho, tum chahte ho ke hamein un se rok do jin ki hamare baap-dada ibadat karte the; to koi saaf daleel le aao\u2019. Unke Rasoolon ne kaha \u2018hum sirf tum jaise insaan hain, magar Allah apne bandon mein se jise chahta hai apna fazl deta hai, aur hamare ikhtiyar mein nahi ke hum tumhare paas koi daleel laayen siwa Allah ke izn ke, aur imaan walon ko Allah hi par bharosa karna chahiye. Aur hum Allah par bharosa kyun na karein jabke usne hamein hamare raaste dikha diye; aur jo takleef tum hamein doge hum us par sabr karenge, aur bharosa karne walon ko usi par bharosa karna chahiye\u2019. Ibn Kathir (\u2018The Argument between the Prophets and the Disbelievers\u2019): jab qaumon ne sirf Allah ki ibadat ke paighaam par shak kiya to Rasoolon ne kaha \u2018kya Allah ke baare mein shak hai?\u2019 yani uski Rububiyat aur akele ibadat ke haqdaar hone ke baare mein. Ibn Kathir ne likha ke aksar qaumein aur aaj bhi Khaaliq ke wujood ka iqraar karti hain magar woh wasilon ko pukarti hain jinhein woh samajhti hain ke unhein nafa dengi ya Allah ke qareeb karengi. Rasoolon ne kaha ke Allah gunaahon ko aakhirat mein bakhshta hai aur dunya mein mohlat deta hai. (\u2018Disbelievers reject Prophethood because the Messengers were Humans!\u2019): is heading ke tehat ka mufassal bayan Story Mode mein padha nahi gaya; yahan ayat ke apne maane diye gaye hain."
