     "h": "\u2018Kalimah tayyibah\u2019 jaise achha darakht, aur \u2018kalimah khabeethah\u2019",
     "t": "Ayah 24\u201326: kya tum ne nahi dekha ke Allah ne kaisi misaal di hai: pakeeza baat ek pakeeza darakht ki tarah hai jis ki jad mazboot hai aur shaakhein aasman mein hain; woh apne Rabb ke izn se har waqt apna phal deta hai; aur Allah logon ke liye misalein bayan karta hai taake woh nasihat pakden. Aur gandi baat ki misaal ek gande darakht ki tarah hai jise zameen ke upar se ukhaD diya gaya ho, us ke liye koi thehrao nahi. Ibn Kathir (\u2018The Parable of the Word of Islam and the Word of Kufr\u2019): \u2018Ali bin Abi Talhah ne Ibn \u2018Abbas se naql kiya ke \u2018pakeeza baat\u2019 ka matlab \u2018La ilaha illallah\u2019 ki gawahi hai, \u2018achha darakht\u2019 momin hai, \u2018jad mazboot\u2019 ka matlab hai ke \u2018La ilaha illallah\u2019 momin ke dil mein mazboot hai, aur \u2018shaakhein aasman mein\u2019 ka matlab momin ke amal aasman ki taraf uthte hain. Ad-Dahhak, Sa\u2018id bin Jubayr, \u2018Ikrimah, Mujahid aur kai doosron ne bhi aisa hi kaha ke yeh misaal momin ke amal, achhi baaton aur achhe kaamon ki hai; momin faida mand khajoor ke darakht ki tarah hai jis ke achhe amal din-raat har waqt uthte rehte hain. Ibn Kathir ne Bukhari ki \u2018Abdullah bin \u2018Umar ki hadith naql ki: \u2018hum Rasool \ufdfa ke saath the to aap ne poocha: mujhe ek aise darakht ke baare mein batao jo musalman jaisa hai, jis ke patte na garmi mein girte hain na sardi mein, aur woh apne Rabb ke izn se har waqt phal deta hai\u2019. Ibn \u2018Umar ne kaha \u2018mere dil mein aaya ke yeh khajoor ka darakht hai, magar maine Abu Bakr aur \u2018Umar ko khamosh dekha to bolne mein sharm ki; jab unhon ne jawab na diya to Rasool \ufdfa ne farmaya: yeh khajoor ka darakht hai\u2019. Bukhari 4698 ke matn (hadithunlocked.com par dekha) mein yeh bhi hai ke jab Ibn \u2018Umar ne apne walid \u2018Umar se kaha ke mere dil mein khajoor aaya tha to \u2018Umar ne kaha \u2018agar tum kehte to mujhe falaan falaan cheez se zyada pasand hota\u2019. Yeh hadith Sahih al-Bukhari 61 mein hai (Ibn \u2018Umar se; sunnah.com par dekhi gayi: https://sunnah.com/bukhari:61), aur Sahih al-Bukhari 4698 mein bhi jo Surah Ibrahim ki ayat 24\u201326 ke tafseer ke baab mein hai (hadithunlocked.com par dekha). Sahih Muslim 2811 mein bhi (sunnah.com par dekhi gayi: https://sunnah.com/muslim:2811)."
